      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just about resting though... like you said, it's about the pretending. even when i'm \"resting\" i'm still just waiting for the next time i have to put the mask back on. how am i supposed to find \"support\" when the world itself feels like the problem? it feels like there's no version of the future where i can just exist without this constant, exhausting battle. it just feels like a losing game.\n Balance the idea carefully. My goal is to",
