    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that sounds so far off. like, maybe in some distant future, but right now it just feels so heavy. i look at people who just get to be themselves naturally and i get so jealous. it's like they're playing a different game. i'm just stuck in this loop of struggle and it makes me wonder if there's even a point to continuing the fight if it's just gonna be this way forever.\n Balance the idea carefully. My goal is to the idea",
